<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Resort Amenities & Rules | Puffer Isle Resort</title>

  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/islelogo.png" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/all.min.css">

  <style>
    :root {
      --brand-color: #FFD700; 
      --brand-hover: #e6c200;
      --accent-teal: #008080;
      --dark: #1a1a1a;
      --light-bg: #f9f9f9;
      --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      --danger: #d90429;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%);
      color: var(--dark);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    main {
      padding: 140px 20px 80px 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .rules-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--glass);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-radius: 40px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr; /* Matching your 1.2fr 0.8fr layout */
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      animation: slideUp 1s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
    }

    @keyframes slideUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(50px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* ================= LEFT SIDE: CONTENT ================= */
    .content-side {
      padding: 50px;
      background: white;
    }

    .content-side h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    .section-label {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: var(--accent-teal);
    }

    .description-text {
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* AMENITY GRID (Matching Room Card Vibe) */
    .amenity-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 15px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .amenity-item {
      padding: 15px;
      background: #fdfdfd;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #eee;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .amenity-item:hover {
      border-color: var(--brand-color);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .amenity-item i {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--accent-teal);
      margin-right: 15px;
      width: 25px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .amenity-item span {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    /* ================= RIGHT SIDE: IMPORTANT INFO ================= */
    .info-side {
      padding: 50px;
      background: var(--dark);
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .info-header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .fee-card {
      background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.05);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .fee-card h4 {
      color: var(--brand-color);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .fee-card p {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .tour-cta {
      margin-top: auto;
      background: var(--brand-color);
      color: var(--dark);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.4s;
    }

    .tour-cta:hover {
      background: white;
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      .rules-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .info-side { border-radius: 0 0 40px 40px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/navbar') %>

<main>
  <div class="rules-container">
    
    <div class="content-side">
      <h2>About the Space</h2>
      <p class="description-text">
        Welcome to <strong>Puffer Isle Resort</strong>! Our newly built Seabreeze rooms offer amazing views of the ocean and open up right into the beach. 
        Wake up to the sound of waves and the fresh ocean breeze in our beachfront paradise.
      </p>

      <span class="section-label">Room Features</span>
      <div class="amenity-grid">
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-users"></i>
          <span>4-5 Guests Capacity</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-wind"></i>
          <span>AC and Fan Rooms</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-sink"></i>
          <span>Private Bath & Shower</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-umbrella-beach"></i>
          <span>Private Balcony</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-soap"></i>
          <span>Essential Toiletries</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-chair"></i>
          <span>Balcony Dining Set</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <span class="section-label">Resort Amenities</span>
      <div class="amenity-grid">
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-swimmer"></i>
          <span>Swimming Pool</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-wifi"></i>
          <span>Free Fast Wifi</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-car"></i>
          <span>Free Parking</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-utensils"></i>
          <span>Restaurant & Bar</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-child"></i>
          <span>Kids Play Area</span>
        </div>
        <div class="amenity-item">
          <i class="fas fa-hamburger"></i>
          <span>Main Dining Area</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-side">
      <div class="info-header">
        <h3 style="color: var(--brand-color);">Guest Information</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.6;">Dingalan, Aurora Local Policies</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fee-card">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-leaf me-2"></i> Local Eco Fee</h4>
        <p>Dingalan, Aurora charges an eco fee of <strong>₱50 per person</strong> for any non-local person. This is required upon check-in.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fee-card">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-shield-alt me-2"></i> Tourist Insurance</h4>
        <p>A fee of <strong>₱100 per person</strong> is required for accident coverage during your stay. Terms available at the front desk.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fee-card" style="border-style: dashed; background: transparent;">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-concierge-bell me-2"></i> Custom Dining</h4>
        <p>Indulge in local cuisine at our restaurant. For a fee, our chefs can cook specific dishes using ingredients you provide!</p>
      </div>
  
      <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.7rem; margin-top: 15px; opacity: 0.5;">
        Puffer Isle Resort © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %>
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>